# Not part of the page. tools/ holds check_shaders.py, the repo-side check that
# the demo's shader copy still matches the plugin's (and the script that splices
# it), and crosscheck/, which holds the C++ and JavaScript that compare the
# page's port of the CPU half with the test card's numbers and the plugin's own
# code, and the page's picture with the test card's; wrangler would otherwise
# upload them and serve them, which is neither useful nor anybody's business.
tools/
